  "citation": "Rivera N; Bippus P; Hsu-Kim H (2021): Data for \"Relative Reactivity and Bioavailability of Mercury Sorbed to or Coprecipitated with Aged Iron Sulfides\". Net Methylation Potential of Mercury Sulfides for Different Groups of the Methylating Microbial Community. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1768331",
